#: ProcessModel.cc:220
msgid "- Process is doing some work"
msgstr "- Perzess deit wat"

#: ProcessModel.cc:222
msgid "- Process is waiting for something to happen"
msgstr "- Perzess töövt op wat"

#: ProcessModel.cc:224
msgid "- Process has been stopped. It will not respond to user input at the moment"
msgstr "- Perzess wöör anhollen. He antert opstunns nich op Brukeringaven."

#: ProcessModel.cc:226
msgid ""
"- Process has finished and is now dead, but the parent process has not "
"cleaned up"
msgstr "- Perzess is afslaten un doot, man de överornt Perzess hett nich opkloort."

#: ProcessModel.cc:458
#| msgid "User Processes"
msgid "The process name"
msgstr "De Naam vun den Perzess"

#: ProcessModel.cc:460
msgid "The user that owns this process"
msgstr "De Bruker, den de Perzess tohöört"

#: ProcessModel.cc:462
msgid "The controlling terminal that this process is running on."
msgstr "De kuntrulleren Konsool, op de disse Perzess löppt"

#: ProcessModel.cc:464
msgid ""
"The priority that this process is being run with.  Ranges from 19 (very "
"nice, least priority) to -19 (top priority)"
msgstr "De Prioriteet, mit de disse Perzess löppt (vun 19, bannig siet, bet to -19, bannig hooch)"

#: ProcessModel.cc:467
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The CPU usage that this process is currently using.  This can be greater "
"than 100% if you have more than one processor."
msgstr "De CPU-Last vun dissen Perzess. Kann ok grötter as 100% wesen, wenn Du mehr as een Perzesser hest."

#: ProcessModel.cc:469
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of virtual memory space that the process is using, "
"included shared libraries, graphics memory, files on disk, and so on.  This "
"number is almost meaningless.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de virtuelle Spieker, den de Perzess bruukt. Inslaten sünd deelt "
"Bibliotheken, Grafikspieker, Dateien op de Fastplaat usw.  Disse Tall "
"bedüüdt meist nix.</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:471
#| msgid ""
#| "<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process is using "
#| "by itself.  It does not include any swapped out memory, nor the code size "
#| "of its shared libraries.  This is often the most useful figure to judge "
#| "the memory use of a program.<br /><br /></qt>"
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process is using by "
"itself.  It does not include any swapped out memory, nor the code size of "
"its shared libraries.  This is often the most useful figure to judge the "
"memory use of a program.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de physikaalsche Spieker, den de Perzess för sik sülven bruukt. "
"Utlagert Spieker oder Kode binnen deelt Bibliotheken sünd nich inslaten. "
"Disse Tall seggt faken dat mehrste, wenn Een wat över den Spiekerbruuk vun "
"en Programm seggen will.</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:473
msgid ""
"<qt>This is the amount of real physical memory that this process's shared "
"libraries are using.  This memory is shared among all processes that use "
"this library</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Dit is de physikaalsche Spieker, den de deelten Bibliotheken vun dit "
"Programm bruukt. Disse Spieker warrt mit all Perzessen deelt, de een "
"Bibliotheek bruukt.</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:475
msgid "<qt>The command that this process was launched with</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>De Befehl, mit den disse Perzess opropen wöör</qt>"

#: ProcessModel.cc:477
msgid "<qt>The title of any windows that this process is showing</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>De Titel vun Finstern, de dissen Perzess tohöört</qt>"

